## Phase 1 (running) fold!=0 train / fold0 val
| model | epoch now | fold0 val | ETA |
|---|---|---|---|
| bellatrix E-B5@512 (18ep) | ep3 | **0.8603** (ep2) | ~22:45 |
| vega EVA02-B@448 (12ep) | ep2 | **0.8668** | ~21:45 |
